{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "task_family": "incremental_english_modern_japanese_overlay",
  "book_id": "no-longer-human",
  "chunk_id": "no-longer-human-chunk-0235",
  "units": [
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "我丈夫患有肺結核，卻說酒能殺菌什麼的，每天飲酒不斷，結果縮短了自己的壽命。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "My husband had tuberculosis, but he kept saying that alcohol killed germs and things like that, and he drank every day without stopping, which ended up shortening his own life.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "「我非常不安，擔心害怕得不知道如何是好。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"I am terribly uneasy, so worried and frightened that I do not know what to do.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "「我開藥給你。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "\"I will give you some medicine.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "酒必須得戒掉。」",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "But you absolutely must give up alcohol.\"",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "老闆娘（她是一名寡婦，膝下有一個兒子，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The proprietress, who was a widow and had one son,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "考上了千葉還是什麼地方的醫科大學，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "had gotten into a medical university in Chiba or somewhere,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "不久就患上了跟他父親同樣的病，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "but before long he came down with the same illness as his father,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "現在正休學住院接受治療，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and now he had taken a leave from school and was in the hospital receiving treatment,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "家裡還躺著一位中風的公公，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "while at home her father-in-law lay bedridden after a stroke,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "而她自己在五歲時因患小兒麻痺症，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and she herself, having suffered from polio when she was five,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "一條腿已行動不便）",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "had lost the proper use of one leg,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "拄著柺杖，啪嗒啪嗒",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "tapped along on her crutches, clack, clack,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "翻箱倒櫃地找出各種藥品。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and rummaged through shelves and drawers to find all sorts of medicines.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "這是造血劑。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This is a blood-building medicine.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "這是維生素注射液，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This is a vitamin injection solution,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "no-longer-human-zh-p00235",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "這個是注射器。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "and this is the syringe.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
